#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node changed after the page was drawn, so nothing was done. Review it and try again."
msgstr "Nod telah berubah selepas halaman dilukis, jadi tiada tindakan dilakukan. Semak dan cuba lagi."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not allow changing this record."
msgstr "Kebenaran peranti anda tidak membenarkan pengubahan rekod ini."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Name: another fabric already uses this name."
msgstr "Nama: fabrik lain sudah menggunakan nama ini."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "Adapter: another fabric already sweeps this adapter port on this poller. One fabric per adapter port."
msgstr "Penyesuai: fabrik lain sudah menyapu port penyesuai ini pada poller ini. Satu fabrik bagi setiap port penyesuai."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be saved."
msgstr "Fabrik tidak dapat disimpan."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric was saved."
msgstr "Fabrik telah disimpan."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "A sweep of this fabric is running, so nothing was deleted. Try again when it finishes."
msgstr "Sapuan bagi fabrik ini sedang berjalan, jadi tiada apa-apa dipadamkan. Cuba lagi apabila ia selesai."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric and its inventory were deleted. No Cacti device was changed and the fabric was not contacted."
msgstr "Fabrik dan inventorinya telah dipadamkan. Tiada peranti Cacti diubah dan fabrik tidak dihubungi."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The fabric could not be deleted."
msgstr "Fabrik tidak dapat dipadamkan."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was not changed."
msgstr "Identiti nod tidak diubah."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The node identity was updated. It is swept again from the next cycle."
msgstr "Identiti nod telah dikemas kini. Ia akan disapu semula bermula dari kitaran seterusnya."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The device mapping moved to the new node."
msgstr "Pemetaan peranti dipindahkan ke nod baharu."

#: fabric_admin.php
msgid "The proposal could not be confirmed. The nodes may have changed since it was made."
msgstr "Cadangan tidak dapat disahkan. Nod mungkin telah berubah sejak ia dibuat."

